2010 Track ‘Power’ Settles Ahead of Trial", "url": "https://malaysia.news.yahoo.com/lawsuit-over-kanye-west-king-193535923.html"}, {"title": "Universal Music Group Settles King Crimson Royalty Lawsuit Over Kanye West’s “Power”", "url": "https://music.mxdwn.com/2024/05/20/news/universal-music-group-settles-king-crimson-royalty-lawsuit-over-kanye-wests-power/amp/"}, {"title": "music.mxdwn.com", "url": "https://music.mxdwn.com/?p=388972"}, {"title": "Universal Music hit with lawsuit for Kanye West's 'Power' - News - Mixmag", "url": "https://mixmag.net/read/universal-music-lawsuit-for-kanye-west-power-news"}, {"title": "King Crimson Sues Kanye West for Sample Use on \"Power\"27.04.2022", "url": "https://papaya.rocks/en/news/king-crimson-wytacza-proces-kanye-westowi-poszlo-o-sampel"}]}, "Here's what the search turned up about Kanye West's \"Power\" and the King Crimson sample:\n\n- **The sample:** Prog rock band King Crimson's \"21st Century Schizoid Man\" is sampled in \"Power,\" which appears on West's 2010 album *My Beautiful Dark Twisted Fantasy*. The song prominently features a vocal sample from \"21st Century Schizoid Man.\"\n- **The dispute:** The rights holder, Declan Colgan Music Ltd (DCM), sued Universal Music Group in London's High Court in March 2022. DCM claimed that UMG had been underpaying streaming royalties arising from \"Power.\" According to the lawsuit, West originally sampled the track without a license before uploading it to YouTube in 2010.\n- **The license deal:** After the fact, UMG and West's company, Rock the World, reached an agreement with DCM. It granted permission to sample the track in return for a 5.33% royalty on each copy of \"Power\" that was sold or \"otherwise exploited.\"\n- **Settlement:** The case was set for trial but settled out of court. The terms were not disclosed, though Variety understood that DCM received a payment as part of the agreement. West was not a party to the suit."], "durationSeconds": 6.72067525, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_012hrdtzDYsKWD5PBtnRHQ3F", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01KsHqj6AKHQe4AZ4jgH2rCV", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Fripp\"}, {\"url\": \"https://Wikipedia.com/wiki/Robert_Fripp\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.last.fm/de/music/Robert+Fripp/+wiki\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.rockol.it/artista/robert-fripp\"}, {\"url\": \"https://roughtrade.com/gb/robert-fripp\"}, {\"url\": \"https://vip-booking.com/details?id=8265\"}, {\"url\": \"https://events.musicofourdesire.com/artist/robert-fripp\"}, {\"url\": \"https://wikipedia2007.classicistranieri.com/r/o/b/Robert_Fripp_bbc4.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://wikipedia.classicistranieri.com/en/articles/r/o/b/Robert_Fripp_bbc4.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://beta.flicklist.tv/people/robert-fripp\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:02:02.848Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Robert Fripp born King Crimson leader", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01HixuLHf5zR5vDZgpwX6hpg", "content": [{"title": "Robert Fripp", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Fripp"}, {"title": "Robert Fripp", "url": "https://Wikipedia.com/wiki/Robert_Fripp"}, {"title": "www.last.fm", "url": "https://www.last.fm/de/music/Robert+Fripp/+wiki"}, {"title": "robert fripp", "url": "https://www.rockol.it/artista/robert-fripp"}, {"title": "Robert Fripp", "url": "https://roughtrade.com/gb/robert-fripp"}, {"title": "Robert Fripp", "url": "https://vip-booking.com/details?id=8265"}, {"title": "robert fripp", "url": "https://events.musicofourdesire.com/artist/robert-fripp"}, {"title": "Static Wikipedia February 2008 (no images)", "url": "https://wikipedia2007.classicistranieri.com/r/o/b/Robert_Fripp_bbc4.html"}, {"title": "Robert Fripp bbc4", "url": "https://wikipedia.classicistranieri.com/en/articles/r/o/b/Robert_Fripp_bbc4.html"}, {"title": "robert fripp", "url": "https://beta.flicklist.tv/people/robert-fripp"}]}, "Robert Fripp was born on 16 May 1946 in Wimborne Minster, Dorset, England. Sources describe him as the founder and only constant member of King Crimson, the progressive rock band.\n\n- **Background:** He began playing guitar at the age of eleven, and his first professional work came in 1967 with Giles, Giles and Fripp.\n- **King Crimson:** Fripp and drummer Michael Giles planned the band in 1968, with Greg Lake, Peter Sinfield and Ian McDonald. Its debut album, *In the Court of the Crimson King* (1969), is regarded as one of the most influential albums in the history of progressive rock. The band broke up shortly afterward, and Fripp has remained the only consistent member of the band.\n- **Other work:** He has worked as a session musician with artists including David Bowie, Blondie, Brian Eno, Peter Gabriel and Talking Heads. He also developed Frippertronics and Soundscapes, looping and delay-based guitar methods, and founded the Guitar Craft seminars in the mid-1980s.\n- **Business:** He co-runs the label DGM (Discipline Global Mobile), which releases King Crimson material.\n\nSources differ on some details. Wikipedia lists his years active as 1967 to 2009 and from 2013, while the Wikipedia mirror says 1967 to present. Some older pages give a lower count of studio credits, while a more recent Wikipedia mirror cites over 700 official releases. Fripp's age and marital status also vary across older pages, so the most recent sources should be preferred."], "durationSeconds": 6.586411375000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01KsHqj6AKHQe4AZ4jgH2rCV", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDXtRtmAwWfmXM2yTWX5", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**1946。**\n\n《Power》采样了 King Crimson 的《21st Century Schizoid Man》。King Crimson 的创始人和唯一一直在队的成员是 Robert Fripp，他于 1946 年 5 月 16 日出生在英格兰多塞特郡的 Wimborne Minster。\n\n《Power》里还有别的采样，这里只按 King Crimson 这条回答，因为它是最主要的一条，也是引起版权诉讼的那条。\n\nSources:\n- [Variety：Kanye West 在《Power》中采样 King Crimson 引发诉讼](https://au.variety.com/2022/music/news/universal-music-kanye-west-king-crimson-lawsuit-2159)\n- [Wikipedia：Robert Fripp](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Fripp)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2574, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4297, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 2574}, "output_tokens": 286, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:02:05.648Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDXtRd9NEyjehmXAFtGe"}
